(32,1,'2026-06-22 19:03:16','2026-06-22 19:03:16','<p>A Platform for Dharma-Driven Change</p>			<h2>ShivBodh Trust</h2>		<p>Sampreshan empowers individuals and organizations to raise awareness, gather support, and create positive change for causes related to Sanatana Dharma.</p><p>Our mission is to connect communities, amplify important voices, and provide a trusted platform where meaningful petitions and campaigns can inspire collective action.</p><p>From temple preservation and cultural heritage to social and religious initiatives, Sampreshan helps people come together around the issues that matter most.</p><p>Every signature strengthens a cause. Every voice contributes to change.</p>													<img width=\"2048\" height=\"2048\" src=\"https://sampreshan.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/logo-potra.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://sampreshan.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/logo-potra.png 2048w, https://sampreshan.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/logo-potra-300x300.png 300w, https://sampreshan.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/logo-potra-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://sampreshan.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/logo-potra-150x150.png 150w, https://sampreshan.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/logo-potra-768x768.png 768w, https://sampreshan.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/logo-potra-1536x1536.png 1536w, https://sampreshan.tech/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/logo-potra-624x624.png 624w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px\" />','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','17-revision-v1','','','2026-06-22 19:03:16','2026-06-22 19:03:16','',17,'https://sampreshan.tech/?p=32',0,'revision','',0),
